Package: dicomdeid
Title: DICOM/NIfTI De-Identification Shiny Application
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R Shiny application for de-identifying medical images (DICOM and
    NIfTI) and their metadata for research use, with configurable replacement
    rules, a self-improvement tagging loop, a resumable/parallel bulk engine, and
    a two-role quality-assurance workflow. The DICOM/PHI engine runs in a
    relocatable Python environment via reticulate. Not for diagnosis or clinical
    decision-making.
